@page "/macros"
@inject NavigationManager Navigation

@* The Macros page is gone — scripts replaced it. Scripts are premade macros that run
   natively instead of through AutoHotkey, so there's no separate macro page any more.

   The route stays as a redirect so old links, palette entries and bookmarks still land
   somewhere sensible. *@

@code {
    protected override void OnInitialized()
        => Navigation.NavigateTo("/scripts", replace: true);
}
